; UI atlas.
; essence_*: 9x9 icons with distinct shapes (flame, snowflake, leaf, crescent).
; bubble: 24x24 9-slice source, margins 4px (fill 6 cream); bubble_tail 8x6 attaches under the bottom edge, its
; top row overlaps the bubble's bottom outline. panel: 24x24 9-slice, margins 5px (wood frame, parchment fill).
; heart_*: patience, 9x9; hourglass: 9x9, labels the patience row (same outline style as the hearts).
; Sprites added later go at the end so the packed regions of earlier ones (the theme hard-codes panel) never move.
; grade_*: 9x9 grade stamp icons with distinct shapes (perfect sparkle, good check, meh tilde, misbrew cross).

